OL,3,GNEWSAWhy could a council leader lose
OL,4,Aher job after just four months?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 19 May, Labour's Tahmina Saleem was
OL,7,Fappointed as the new leader of Luton
OL,8,FBorough Council, replacing Hazel
OL,9,FSimmons who had been in charge since
OL,10,F2007.
OL,12,FSo why is Saleem now facing a
OL,13,Fleadership challenge less than four
OL,14,Fmonths later - at an extraordinary
OL,15,Fmeeting this Monday evening.
OL,17,FThe BBC reviews the past six months.
OL,19,FIn March, Simmons announced that she
OL,20,Fwould be standing down as leader.
